[[File:Eternal teleport crystal detail.png|left|100px]]
The '''eternal teleport crystal''' is an item that can be used to teleport to [[Lletya]] and [[Prifddinas]], in a similar fashion to the [[teleport crystal]], but with infinite charges. You cannot obtain it before completing [[Song of the Elves]].

Players can create an eternal teleport crystal via a [[singing bowl]] by combining an [[enhanced crystal teleport seed]] and 100 [[crystal shard]]s. Doing so requires level 80 [[Smithing]] and [[Crafting]] to [[crystal singing|sing]] the crystal (the levels can be [[Temporary skill boost|boosted]]), and grants 5,000 experience in both skills. If the player does not meet the Smithing and Crafting requirements, they can have [[Conwenna]] or [[Reese]] sing the crystal for them for an extra 50 crystal shards, for a total of 150, you are also not granted the experience if made for you.

